aura (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release. Linux packaged as .deb (this package), Windows x64 as MSI.
  * Full toolchain: compiler, bytecode VM with generational GC (opt-in
    concurrent collector), tiered x86-64 JIT, source-level debugger and DAP
    adapter, 74 example programs.

